   "width": 2292,
   "height": 16.25,
   "text": "RelayOS is a single Node process (Fastify) that owns both the JSON API and the built single-page app, persists every entity in PostgreSQL through one async `Db` interface, and derives its delivery-governance behaviour \u2014 SLA clocks, turnover gates, acceptance ladders, ship gates \u2014 from rows in",
   "originalText": "RelayOS is a single Node process (Fastify) that owns both the JSON API and the built single-page app, persists every entity in PostgreSQL through one async `Db` interface, and derives its delivery-governance behaviour \u2014 SLA clocks, turnover gates, acceptance ladders, ship gates \u2014 from rows in",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
