   "id": "txt0315",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 4496.0,
   "width": 2292,
   "height": 20.0,
   "text": "What is genuinely layered, and what is not",
   "originalText": "What is genuinely layered, and what is not",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#334155",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame0235",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 684756454,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1780232535,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1794300000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "txt0316",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 4522.48,
   "width": 2292,
   "height": 14.375,
   "text": "Layered: HTTP handlers (routes/index.ts) \u2192 business rules (services/, domain/) \u2192 data access (db/ + raw SQL in handlers).",
   "originalText": "Layered: HTTP handlers (routes/index.ts) \u2192 business rules (services/, domain/) \u2192 data access (db/ + raw SQL in handlers).",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#334155",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame0235",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1955932336,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1494067262,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1794300000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "txt0317",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 4537.66,
   "width": 2292,
   "height": 14.375,
   "text": "Not layered: there is no ORM, no repository class per entity, and no dependency-injection container. Handlers call SQL directly for simple reads;",
   "originalText": "Not layered: there is no ORM, no repository class per entity, and no dependency-injection container. Handlers call SQL directly for simple reads;",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#334155",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame0235",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 491706179,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1027349385,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1794300000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "txt0318",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 4552.839999999999,
   "width": 2292,
   "height": 14.375,
   "text": "services own multi-step writes and invariant checks. repositories/query.ts is a mapper module (TASK_SELECT, mapProject, mapClient\u2026), not a repository layer.",
   "originalText": "services own multi-step writes and invariant checks. repositories/query.ts is a mapper module (TASK_SELECT, mapProject, mapClient\u2026), not a repository layer.",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#334155",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame0235",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1633379097,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1748948198,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1794300000000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "txt0319",
   "x": 54,
   "y": 4568.0199999999995,
   "width": 2292,
   "height": 14.375,
   "text": "Consequence: fewer indirections to read, and SQL is visible where it runs \u2014 at the cost of some duplication in SELECT lists.",
   "originalText": "Consequence: fewer indirections to read, and SQL is visible where it runs \u2014 at the cost of some duplication in SELECT lists.",
   "fontSize": 11.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#0f172a",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame0235",
   "roundness": null,
