   "height": 14.375,
   "text": "change_log (0017_change_log.sql): method, path, entity_type, entity_id \u2014 one row for every successful mutation, appended by an onResponse hook, so the live-update feed cannot go blind.",
   "originalText": "change_log (0017_change_log.sql): method, path, entity_type, entity_id \u2014 one row for every successful mutation, appended by an onResponse hook, so the live-update feed cannot go blind.",
